> Setup

prerequisite:

Install python 3.11+ > install it > add it to your environmental path.

1. Download and extract the Rar file.
2. Save all the extracted file into one folder "ex; cibil score"
3. Open the folder with VS Code.

For Create Virtual Environment:

Go to view > Command palette > search for "python:select interpreter" > click "create virtual Environment
    > choose the python version > create

Now open new terminal in vs code by, terminal > new terminal 

Now you can see we are in venv folder like this (venv)as green color.

If not just enter this on terminal, " .\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1 "

Then you can see (venv), then start installing requirements file! 

using this:     pip install -r req.txt

Now start the server(app) by this: python app.py

Thats it! now you can get the localhost link! open it!